Dear players!
We are pleased to inform you that update 1.1 has been released, in which the following changes have occurred:
-Shotgun damage increased from 13 to 18 units;
-Increased the number of units of health for a character with a shotgun, now 170 instead of 200;
-Reduced running speed for a character with a shotgun, from 60 to 50 units;
-Characters with a gun now have 140 health units instead of 200;
- The speed of running a character with a machine gun is reduced from 60 units to 45;
-Reduced the amount of health for a character with a rifle from 200 to 130;
-Increased running speed of a character with a rifle from 60 units to 65.
This update came out thanks to your support and feedback! Leave your reviews on the game in Steam, we read each review! And also join our server in Discord, where you can also leave your opinion about the game, leave your wishes for further development and make new friends!
https://discord.gg/8fMCdAf
